<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {!Case.Departure_City__c}&nbsp;on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that on time departure is as much a priority for us as it is for you and we work hard to ensure your flight departs and arrives as close to schedule as possible. While safety must always be our first priority, I certainly appreciate how inconvenient the cancellation was for you.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">In these cases, we will always try to find you an alternative flight to get you to your destination, but if the options available are unsuitable and you no longer wish to travel, we are happy to provide a full refund.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If QF issued ticket add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have checked with our ticketing department and can confirm a refund of ${!Case.Recovery_Value__c}&nbsp;has now been processed back to the original form of payment.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If agent/other airline ticket add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As your ticket was issued by <b>-a travel agent/Expedia/American Airlines etc-</b>, rather than Qantas directly, they will need to process your refund.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If minimal refund due through fare or second instance add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If a Frequent Flyer:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If not a Frequent Flyer:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to arrange a credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}&nbsp;Qantas Points to you. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email, so we can credit points to your account. If you are not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If requesting compensation add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">You will need to refer any unexpected costs to your travel insurance provider. If you require any additional information to make a claim through your policy, please let me know by replying to this email and I would be happy to provide this letter.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If handled poorly add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Your comments about the way this was handled have been forwarded to our Airport Management for review of our oversale handling procedures and we appreciate you taking the time to provide your first-hand experience. Feedback like yours, is vital to developing our service, so we are grateful you took the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for your understanding and we look forward to welcoming you on board in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>